<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>对陌生插件，两条路线都还没有安全答案</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 120, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -2}}>0</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 12}}>条路线，有陌生插件的安全答案</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 26}}>对陌生插件，两条路线都还没有安全答案</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>一条没有沙箱；另一条插件化不等于安全。所以它们都不是「更先进的选择」，是「正在演进的路线」。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 16, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>轻量组装路线</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 10}}>陌生插件能否安全运行</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D", marginTop: 10}}>缺沙箱机制</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>插件化路线</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 10}}>陌生插件能否安全运行</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D", marginTop: 10}}>插件化 ≠ 安全</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>两边都要自己补治理——没有哪条可以直接上生产。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>37 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
